COPY public.catalog_entries (code, domain, lifecycle, problem, datasets, outcome, value_note, key_assumption, input) FROM stdin;
RP-001	Retail Banking	Pilot	Generic marketing campaigns yield low conversion and irritate retail customers across digital touchpoints.	Transaction history, app clickstream, product holdings, demographics, campaign response logs.	Real-time API serving personalized product recommendations and financial tips during app sessions.	Lifts digital campaign conversion on roughly SGD 4.2M of in-scope retail product revenue touched by app recommendations.	Uplift measured in pilot cells persists once recommendations run across all app sessions.	{"name": "Next-Best-Action Predictor", "type": "AI / ML Product", "owner": "Head of Retail Personalisation", "levers": {"risk": 0, "revenue": 2600000, "costSavings": 0, "costAvoidance": 0}, "problem": "Generic marketing campaigns yield low conversion and irritate retail customers across digital touchpoints.", "adoption": 0.55, "userCount": 320, "hoursSaved": 2.5, "businessUnit": "Consumer Banking", "evidenceLevel": "Piloted", "buildInvestment": 520000}
RP-002	Retail Banking	Pilot	High customer attrition rates in primary checking accounts without actionable advance detection.	Balance trends, direct deposit transfers, card transaction frequency, customer service logs, bill pay changes.	Daily risk scores identifying at-risk accounts with automated triggers for relationship retention offers.	Retains net interest and fee income on about SGD 2.6M of at-risk primary-account revenue via early save offers.	Retention offers actually change churn behaviour rather than rewarding customers who would have stayed.	{"name": "Omnichannel Churn Early Warning Indicator", "type": "AI / ML Product", "owner": "Head of Customer Retention", "levers": {"risk": 0, "revenue": 1600000, "costSavings": 0, "costAvoidance": 0}, "problem": "High customer attrition rates in primary checking accounts without actionable advance detection.", "adoption": 0.5, "userCount": 260, "hoursSaved": 3, "businessUnit": "Consumer Banking", "evidenceLevel": "Piloted", "buildInvestment": 340000}
RP-003	Retail Banking	Business Case	Inability to allocate marketing spend and high-touch support to high-yield retail segments effectively.	Historical revenue, cost-to-serve, credit loss history, product tenure, cross-sell trajectories.	Forward-looking 36-month CLV metrics embedded into CRM for tiered service routing and acquisition targeting.	Reallocates acquisition and servicing effort across SGD 2.2M of marketing-influenced retail revenue using 36-month CLV tiers.	Cost-to-serve allocations are accurate enough to rank customer value credibly.	{"name": "Customer Lifetime Value Engine", "type": "Data Product", "owner": "Head of Retail Analytics", "levers": {"risk": 0, "revenue": 1350000, "costSavings": 0, "costAvoidance": 0}, "problem": "Inability to allocate marketing spend and high-touch support to high-yield retail segments effectively.", "adoption": 0.6, "userCount": 180, "hoursSaved": 4, "businessUnit": "Consumer Banking", "evidenceLevel": "Benchmarked", "buildInvestment": 380000}
RP-004	Retail Banking	Approved	Static credit limits lead to lost transaction volume or unmitigated credit risk exposure.	Income estimates, real-time balance usage, payment history, credit bureau updates, debt-to-income indicators.	Dynamic API calculating automated limit increases or decreases based on instantaneous liquidity changes.	Dynamic limits grow spend-driven interchange and interest on SGD 3.4M in-scope revenue while trimming a SGD 14M loss pool.	Regulator and internal credit policy permit automated limit changes without fresh customer consent.	{"name": "Real-time Credit Line Optimization Feed", "type": "Decision Engine", "owner": "Head of Cards & Unsecured Lending", "levers": {"risk": 14000000, "revenue": 2100000, "costSavings": 0, "costAvoidance": 0}, "problem": "Static credit limits lead to lost transaction volume or unmitigated credit risk exposure.", "adoption": 0.6, "userCount": 45, "hoursSaved": 5, "businessUnit": "Consumer Banking", "evidenceLevel": "Benchmarked", "buildInvestment": 480000}
RP-005	Retail Banking	Business Case	Sub-optimal deposit pricing causes deposit flight to competitors during changing rate environments.	Account-level interest rates, balance changes, competitor rate feeds, local economic indicators.	Elasticity scoring engine outputting optimized interest rate tiers to maximize retention while controlling interest expense.	Tiered elasticity pricing protects roughly SGD 3.1M of net interest income on rate-sensitive retail deposit balances.	Historic rate-cycle elasticities still hold in Singapore's current competitive deposit market.	{"name": "Deposit Decay & Price Sensitivity Matrix", "type": "Decision Engine", "owner": "Head of Deposits & Liabilities", "levers": {"risk": 0, "revenue": 1900000, "costSavings": 0, "costAvoidance": 0}, "problem": "Sub-optimal deposit pricing causes deposit flight to competitors during changing rate environments.", "adoption": 0.65, "userCount": 35, "hoursSaved": 6, "businessUnit": "Consumer Banking", "evidenceLevel": "Benchmarked", "buildInvestment": 420000}
RP-006	Retail Banking	Idea	Broad demographic targeting fails to capture nuanced lifestyle spend patterns.	Credit/debit card merchant category codes, geolocation data, recurring subscription patterns, timing of spend.	Dynamic behavioral clusters exported to customer engagement platforms for hyper-targeted engagement.	Behavioural clusters sharpen targeting across about SGD 1.8M of campaign-attributable retail card and lending revenue.	Merchant-category and geolocation use stays within PDPA consent already obtained from customers.	{"name": "Micro-Segmentation & Behavioral Profiling Engine", "type": "Data Product", "owner": "Head of Customer Segmentation", "levers": {"risk": 0, "revenue": 1100000, "costSavings": 0, "costAvoidance": 0}, "problem": "Broad demographic targeting fails to capture nuanced lifestyle spend patterns.", "adoption": 0.55, "userCount": 120, "hoursSaved": 3.5, "businessUnit": "Consumer Banking", "evidenceLevel": "Benchmarked", "buildInvestment": 300000}
RP-007	Retail Banking	Production	Digital product managers lack visibility into user drop-offs within mobile banking workflows.	App event logs, session length, device metadata, operating system metrics, error logs.	Event stream analytics pipeline delivering real-time UX bottleneck heatmaps and onboarding funnel drop-off metrics.	Saves product squads manual funnel analysis and avoids a SGD 220K planned third-party mobile analytics renewal.	In-house event pipeline fully replaces the vendor tool rather than running alongside it.	{"name": "Mobile App Feature Adoption Analytics", "type": "Dashboard", "owner": "Head of Digital Product Analytics", "levers": {"risk": 0, "revenue": 0, "costSavings": 0, "costAvoidance": 220000}, "problem": "Digital product managers lack visibility into user drop-offs within mobile banking workflows.", "adoption": 0.6, "userCount": 90, "hoursSaved": 3, "businessUnit": "Consumer Banking", "evidenceLevel": "Benchmarked", "buildInvestment": 210000}
RP-008	Retail Banking	Business Case	Customers obtain mortgages or refinance with third-party lenders without the bank's knowledge.	Property valuation trends, credit bureau inquiries, major outward wire transfers, savings trajectory, rate movements.	Predictive scoring stream alerting mortgage specialists when a retail customer enters the home-buying cycle.	Early home-buying signals defend roughly SGD 4.6M of mortgage margin otherwise lost to competitor refinancing.	Specialists contact flagged customers within days, before a competitor offer is signed.	{"name": "Mortgage Propensity & Refinancing Engine", "type": "AI / ML Product", "owner": "Head of Mortgages", "levers": {"risk": 0, "revenue": 2850000, "costSavings": 0, "costAvoidance": 0}, "problem": "Customers obtain mortgages or refinance with third-party lenders without the bank's knowledge.", "adoption": 0.5, "userCount": 210, "hoursSaved": 2.5, "businessUnit": "Consumer Banking", "evidenceLevel": "Benchmarked", "buildInvestment": 400000}
